{"2343580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ghoul Fright", "steam_appid": 2343580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4970560], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/2a0cadd38996cf2622371d058c801c6a.avif?t=1787830639\" width=840 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>The Ghouls are coming for you!</strong></u><strong>  Play like your life is at stake and defend yourself from these terrifying and scary creatures, from farty strong zombies, to deadly mafia skeletons that will put you down, survive 3 waves to beat the game!! With increasing difficulty and Cursed waves with new challenges  </strong>   <br><strong>  </strong>  <br><strong> ¿Can you survive this insanity?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PUNCH THE GHOULS BRUTALLY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DAMN! That's a lotta damage!!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use your bare-knuckle</strong> <strong>combat to deal with the Ghouls in many cool ways, from simple punching, heavy charges and lethal grabs, DON'T LET THEM HURT YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/1706ee71afe22a116d7e26169eebf132.avif?t=1787830639\" width=256 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coop multiplayer + Single player</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 Players max</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game chat (T Key)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice proximity chat with cartoony effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONS OF GHOULS TO FIGHT!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructive environment with procedural chunks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave based survival with progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully physical combat with ragdolls and parries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Skills per Survivor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+62 Talents per Survivor with many effects (Custom builds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling and experience to upgrade your Talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fright Shop - Your shop to buy upgrades to survive longer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fright Gear - Where you will equip your gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLAP to revive anything, Literally!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLY ABSURD MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0a137d471da47a3664b5931111bdffea.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0a137d471da47a3664b5931111bdffea.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0a137d471da47a3664b5931111bdffea.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THIS IS GOING NUTS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use your environment as a weapon, grab props to attack the Ghouls, throw them with a heavy attack launch and stomp their heads into the ground, this is a literal playground of violence, use it!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">VIOLENT SURVIVAL PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/eea89ca4044c76650862831d83d0b47e.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/eea89ca4044c76650862831d83d0b47e.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/eea89ca4044c76650862831d83d0b47e.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You and your friends against the Ghoul invasion!  </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Protect each other and survive unleashed hellish waves of cartoony Ghouls as you fight and execute combat tactics to defeat all of your enemies, revive them with a good waking slap and be careful of not killing each other with a chair!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/2a0cadd38996cf2622371d058c801c6a.avif?t=1787830639\" width=840 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>The Ghouls are coming for you!</strong></u><strong>  Play like your life is at stake and defend yourself from these terrifying and scary creatures, from farty strong zombies, to deadly mafia skeletons that will put you down, survive 3 waves to beat the game!! With increasing difficulty and Cursed waves with new challenges  </strong>   <br><strong>  </strong>  <br><strong> ¿Can you survive this insanity?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PUNCH THE GHOULS BRUTALLY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DAMN! That's a lotta damage!!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use your bare-knuckle</strong> <strong>combat to deal with the Ghouls in many cool ways, from simple punching, heavy charges and lethal grabs, DON'T LET THEM HURT YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/1706ee71afe22a116d7e26169eebf132.avif?t=1787830639\" width=256 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coop multiplayer + Single player</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>4 Players max</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game chat (T Key)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice proximity chat with cartoony effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONS OF GHOULS TO FIGHT!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructive environment with procedural chunks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave based survival with progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully physical combat with ragdolls and parries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Unique Skills per Survivor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+62 Talents per Survivor with many effects (Custom builds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling and experience to upgrade your Talents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fright Shop - Your shop to buy upgrades to survive longer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fright Gear - Where you will equip your gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SLAP to revive anything, Literally!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEADLY ABSURD MAYHEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0a137d471da47a3664b5931111bdffea.poster.avif?t=1787830639\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0a137d471da47a3664b5931111bdffea.webm?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0a137d471da47a3664b5931111bdffea.mp4?t=1787830639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THIS IS GOING NUTS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Use your environment as a weapon, grab props to attack the Ghouls, throw them with a heavy attack launch and stomp their heads into the ground, this is a literal playground of violence, use it!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">VIOLENT SURVIVAL PARTY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style